{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","questions":[{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q01","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5d578eacb9b65653dc51005a3d775674317d75bc09af1bc3abdf7fb12d9b093c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 比值定义法是物理学中常用的研究方法，它用两个基本的物理量的“比”来定义一个新的物理量。定义的物理量往往是反映物质的最本质的属性，它不随定义所用物理量的大小而改变，下面式子属于比值定义法的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac { F } { m }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"I = { \\frac { U } { R } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"C = \\frac { \\mathrm { E } _ { r } s } { 4 \\pi k d }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi = \\frac { E _ { \\mathrm { p } } } { q }"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q02","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0a2076cae3f1bd8956a0ee88ab84409642ccbbf26992bf8109ae343c3681b218","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 下面四幅课本插图中包含的物理思想方法相同的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6e21729bf523ced5595005ee4ae2de6cac5769094ee52684c9862ed7a986802f.png","width":259,"height":211,"width_mm":30.364,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e29f3a78f905dbb8b52897d3b5310e3a1d98c557eddc796fb266db9dea9e2fc6.png","width":265,"height":233,"width_mm":31.1,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b20197fc47bb142d31b5ca778ea6355decffd2467623f55e6e20ba5b855aef9a.png","width":257,"height":204,"width_mm":30.18,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ed9cc393b3d7847888c98dcfd0e144cb6fdb1d208f6ca1ec408066c958125d30.png","width":211,"height":203,"width_mm":24.659,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丁\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 甲和乙"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 乙和丙"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 乙和丁"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 丙和丁"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q03","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q03","number":"3","order":3,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5915e45e498df97c440a5216e68fb8415cb3b7801d0f839363f18765799099e2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 国际拔河比赛规定，每个队按8名运动员体重的总和分成若干重量级别，同等级别的两个队进行比赛。如图所示，运动员必须穿“拔河鞋”或没有鞋跟等突出物的平底鞋，不能戴手套。不计拔河绳的质量，认为拔河过程中绳始终保持水平，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fc6bde78dad73fdd7d4f45ab65f49fd629dc0cbf8973b96250c02abe49395708.png","width":411,"height":251,"width_mm":48.214,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q03-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 地面对运动员的作用力方向竖直向上"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 获胜队伍对绳的拉力大小等于失败队伍对绳的拉力大小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 拔河绳对两支队伍的拉力是一对相互作用力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 比赛过程中两队队员受到的地面摩擦力总是等大反向"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q04","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f54cf822cb62f0da6ac7d3d29fe176ae772a1517f7ed62e19a6838b34fb4b634","body":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 引力波是时空弯曲中的涟漪，由宇宙中质量巨大的天体发生加速运\n动、碰撞合并等剧烈事件引发，会以光速c在宇宙中传播。若已知某双星系统辐射引力波的功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"P = \\frac{2}{5c^{5}}G^{4}M^{m}R^{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。其中G为引力常量、M为星球的质量、R为双星之间的距离，则m、n分别为\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. m=5、n=-5"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. m=5、n=-3"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. m=3、n=-2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. m=5、n=2"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q05","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"be07599708cdf398e5ce2bfd2a8b9596da7d3b6d4e4939997168c3b83d52a97c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"5. 乌贼被称为“海中火箭”，其“外套膜”能够迅速收缩，将海水高速喷出进而向另一方向加速冲刺，可轻易加速到15m/s。一质量为0.5kg（不含体内水）的乌贼初始时静止，某时刻以相对于地面恒为40m/s的速度水平喷水，不计水的阻力且不考虑竖直方向的运动和受力变化，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/177715409eba187ef00045c58cd23608d6871f1b32861ee227a817f16594b604.png","width":372,"height":174,"width_mm":43.613,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 5 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 乌贼喷水过程中乌贼和喷出的水组成的系统水平方向动量不守恒"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B.乌贼向后喷水，喷出的水对周围的水产生一个作用力，周围的水对喷出的水的反作用力使乌贼向前运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若乌贼要在极短时间内达到15m/s的速度，则要一次性喷出约0.19kg的水"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D.若乌贼要在极短时间内达到15m/s的速度，此过程中乌贼受到它喷出的水的作用力的冲量为20N·s"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q06","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6ee82c5385a808a8fc7d9d01cf4014bfc4b04db8ba99ec151d5f4a4e20b96869","body":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 磁阱常用来约束带电粒子的运动。如图所示，四根通有大小相等且为恒定电流的长直导线垂直穿过xOy平面，1、2、3、4直导线与xOy平面的交点成边长为2a的正方形且关于x轴和y轴对称，各导线中电流方向已标出，已知无限长通电直导线产生的磁感应强度大小与到直导线距离成反比，题中带电粒子重力不计，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cf1700258578113261e523a6ea493819ad63b95934816a2a9059691f25321156.png","width":336,"height":302,"width_mm":39.381,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q06-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 导线2、4连线上各点的磁感应强度均为0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 从O点处平行导线入射的带电粒子做匀速直线运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. x轴上虚线框内各点磁感应强度相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 沿着y轴正方向入射的粒子在坐标平面内做匀速圆周运动"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q07","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b7ef3a94fb4520e4e6f9cbbfe69303b701349fc9882a587b8142d5dfb683639a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"7. 光镊技术可以用来捕获、操控微小粒子（目前已达微米级），其原理是光在接触物体后，会对其产生力的作用，虽然这个作用力很微小，但对于微小的物体如细胞，这种作用力足够使它发生移动。如图所示是某次激光操控微粒的光路示意图，a、b为完全相同的激光束，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ad3475b40395de9db7677e6025624de12419f807339e1019702b22dca8635a3c.png","width":357,"height":321,"width_mm":41.773,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q07-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 光镊技术利用光的直线传播特性"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 激光进入该微粒后传播速度不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 此次操控对微粒产生向上的作用力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 只减少激光束b的强度，对微粒有向左的分力作用"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q08","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4f9be8753e410eadecb8486b2040e592bab64f0ce8488d2f0e97149658fba743","body":[{"type":"text","value":"8. 角速度计可测量飞机、航天器、潜艇的转动角速度，成为飞机、卫星等的制导系统的信息源。其简化结构如图所示，质量为m的元件A与轻质弹簧连接，可在杆上自由滑动，弹簧的自然长度\n为L、劲度系数为k，电源电动势为E、内阻不计，滑动变阻器总长也为L，电阻分布均匀，系统静止时P在B点，不计一切阻力，当系统绕轴"},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":"以角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"转动时，元件A发生位移并输出相应的电压信号，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/66bb524ca407f08117d0737bcce4b01061dc5114203b64b3d4c43eab2aba37fe.png","width":399,"height":381,"width_mm":46.742,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q08-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 电路中电流随角速度的增大而增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 输出电压随角速度的增大而减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 弹簧的伸长量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = \\frac{m \\omega L}{k - m \\omega^2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 输出电压U与"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"的函数式为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{E m \\omega^{2}}{k - m \\omega^{2}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q09","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9c72dac22805ac0d9d6d90688a5789e3f24ec9bb03e73396bfb77e9697a4394f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9. 在量子引力理论中，普朗克长度被视为可探测的最小空间尺度。一种估算方法是考虑如下思想实验:为了探测更小的空间结构，需要更高能量的光子。但当光子能量极高时，其自身引力效应显著，可能形成一个微观黑洞，(理论分析表明，逃逸速度是环绕速度的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 倍，即 "},{"type":"math","value":"v ^ { ' } = \\sqrt { \\frac { 2 G m } { R } } \\; )"},{"type":"text","value":"从而无法提供更小的尺度信息。高中阶段为了简化运算，我们可以令光子的波长等于4"},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"乘以黑洞的半径（设黑洞的半径等于普朗克长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L _ { p } \\; )"},{"type":"text","value":" ，我们就可以得到最小的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L _ { p }"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知光子的能量\n为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E = { \\frac { h c } { \\lambda } }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，有效质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = { \\frac { E } { c ^ { ^ 2 } } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 。普朗克常数 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 6.63 \\times 10^{-34} J"},{"type":"text","value":" ·s，真空光速 "},{"type":"math","value":"c = 3 \\times 10^{8} m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" ，引力常数 "},{"type":"math","value":"G = 6.67 \\times 10^{-11} Nm^2 kg^{-2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则普朗克长度约为\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"1.6 \\times 10^{-35} m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"1.6 \\times 10^{-33} m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"1.1 \\times 10^{-37} m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"1 . 1 \\times 1 0 ^ { - 4 0 } m"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q10","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"57c0ccf72fe172c527abc2c646013577a71be566774bf6e45c48523fff8b27d1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 如图1所示，把一个小球放在玻璃漏斗中，晃动漏斗，可以使小球在短时间内沿漏斗壁在某一水平面内做匀速圆周运动，并不落向漏斗下方。我们用如下模型对此进行分析:如图2所示一圆锥体（圆锥的顶点为O，底面圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O ^ { ' } )"},{"type":"text","value":" 绕垂直于水平面的轴线以恒定的角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"转动，一质量为m小物体（可看作质点）随圆锥体一起转动且相对于圆锥体静止。以圆锥体为参考系，圆锥体中的小物体还多受到一个“力”，同时小物体还将具有一个与这个“力”对应的“势能”。为便于研究，在过轴线的平面上，以顶点O为坐标原点、以竖直向上为y轴正方向建立xOy直角坐标系，小物体在这个坐标系中具有的“势能”可表示为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E _ { _ { p x } } = - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } m \\omega ^ { 2 } x ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 。该“势能”与小物体的重力势能之和为其总势能。当小物体处在圆锥壁上总势能最小的某一位置时，小物体既没有沿圆锥面上滑的趋势，也没有沿圆锥面下滑的趋势，此时小物体受到的摩擦力就会恰好为0，即使圆锥壁光滑，小物体也不会滑向下方。根据以上信息可知，下列说法中正确的是（）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f03327632969063fb64c28b7cf238c3c671dbf8701ec1884273335311d70a54b.png","width":241,"height":251,"width_mm":28.156,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n第10题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8451e820a95f2e1300badc678a95d96eb15f85fada32a84d1b669e968f2506c4.png","width":305,"height":298,"width_mm":35.7,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 小物体多受到的那个“力”的方向指向 "},{"type":"math","value":"O ^ { ' }"},{"type":"text","value":" 点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 小物体多受到的那个“力”的大小随x的增加而减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 该“势能”的表达式 "},{"type":"math","value":"E _ { p x } = - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } m \\omega ^ { 2 } x ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 是选取了x轴处“势能”为零"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 当圆锥体以恒定的角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"'转动时 "},{"type":"math","value":"( \\omega ' { > } \\omega )"},{"type":"text","value":" ，将小物体沿圆锥壁向下移至某一位置时受到的摩擦力才可能恰好为0"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q11","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","电学","光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"01ac67ae6a118233d889b05793754fef89c11154ed5f3f173c0dc371dfaf1cd4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11.下列说法正确的是:\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 自由落体过程中任意连续相等时间通过的位移之比可能为2:3"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 电场线一定是不闭合的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 光电效应实验中光的频率越高，逸出光电子的动能就越大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 根据玻尔的氢原子理论,氢原子由低能级向高能级跃迁时动能变小、电势能增大"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q12","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"efa1d51128a721c397a79ac9f036e33a5c9926d70173dcc0a087e47d4d3ab84e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 一列简谐横波沿 x 轴正方向传播，从某时刻开始计时，在t=6s时的波形如图（a）所示。在x轴正方向，距离原点小于一个波长的A 质点，其振动图象如图（b）所示。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bbeb5c895e2886cbf19330b0ac85a56c63965a978faa502fe0f2354ca2e860df.png","width":399,"height":198,"width_mm":46.742,"row_group":"xinzhendi-jiaoyu-lianmeng-2603-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 a\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/93f0a952f6fcbee933333db25abfc545e1d39f05e6d3c0fe5